{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><u><strong>EXPLORE DANGEROUS AREAS, DEFEAT ENEMIES, AND RECOVER THE TRI-CRYSTAL BEFORE IT'S TOO LATE!</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077920/extras/c1d5872c76bb97fb07385154e9939ade.poster.avif?t=1762532914\" width=480 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077920/extras/c1d5872c76bb97fb07385154e9939ade.webm?t=1762532914\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077920/extras/c1d5872c76bb97fb07385154e9939ade.mp4?t=1762532914\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077920/extras/79c4442ff811f90327cc7c82539e57ac.avif?t=1762532914\" width=616 height=150 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Bobble and the Tri-Crystal is a 2D side-scrolling shoot 'em up, inspired by retro handheld consoles. You will face stages where you must reach the end while dodging enemy attacks!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Enter the ocean and play as Bobble, a fish agent, to stop the escaped prisoners before they get their hands on the Tri-Crystal!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077920/extras/5dc1eb253e68969f4178e9bf2c7d4e7f.avif?t=1762532914\" width=616 height=150 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You'll also face  bosses: prisoners who escaped to unlock their true potential with the Tri-Crystal! Learn their patterns, dodge their attacks, and shoot them down!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077920/extras/aadd14396669fa74b96684722525b89a.poster.avif?t=1762532914\" width=480 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077920/extras/aadd14396669fa74b96684722525b89a.webm?t=1762532914\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077920/extras/aadd14396669fa74b96684722525b89a.mp4?t=1762532914\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Defeating enemies earns you<i>\u00a0Hero Credits</i>, which can be used to purchase new skills from the shop! Enter a level with two weapons at once, and press a button to switch between them!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077920/extras/6e7b8e1dc972173b748fcb05dd535087.avif?t=1762532914\" width=1200 height=578 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4077920?t=1762532914","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077920/1b27c6b67c9b12818f511816f8cf46c2caeb9861/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762532914","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077920/35932b82c3ad8e8c0c3bd92977bc600f4627b1c0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762532914","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077920/35932b82c3ad8e8c0c3bd92977bc600f4627b1c0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762532914","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><u><strong>EXPLORE DANGEROUS AREAS, DEFEAT ENEMIES, AND RECOVER THE TRI-CRYSTAL BEFORE IT'S TOO LATE!</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077920/extras/c1d5872c76bb97fb07385154e9939ade.poster.avif?t=1762532914\" width=480 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077920/extras/c1d5872c76bb97fb07385154e9939ade.webm?t=1762532914\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077920/extras/c1d5872c76bb97fb07385154e9939ade.mp4?t=1762532914\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077920/extras/79c4442ff811f90327cc7c82539e57ac.avif?t=1762532914\" width=616 height=150 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Bobble and the Tri-Crystal is a 2D side-scrolling shoot 'em up, inspired by retro handheld consoles. You will face stages where you must reach the end while dodging enemy attacks!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Enter the ocean and play as Bobble, a fish agent, to stop the escaped prisoners before they get their hands on the Tri-Crystal!</p><p class=\"bb_parag